{"hymn":"S680","parent":"E1224","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Dejamos por Jesús la ley","subtitle":"La iglesia—Como ciudad de Dios","syl":{"n1":["De","i"],"n2":["ja","m"],"n3":["mos","t"],"n4":"por","n5":["Je","i"],"n6":["sús","t"],"n7":"la","n8":"ley,","n9":"En","n10":"Él","n11":["po","i"],"n12":["ne","m"],"n13":["mos","t"],"n14":["nues","i"],"n15":["tra","t"],"n16":"fe;","n17":"Su","n18":["glo","i"],"n19":["ria","t"],"n20":["ha","i"],"n22":["ce","t"],"n23":["com","i"],"n24":["pren","m"],"n25":["der","t"],"n26":"Que","n27":"el","n28":["to","i"],"n29":["do","t"],"n30":["Cris","i"],"n31":["to‿es.","t"],"n33":"Nos","n34":["da","i"],"n35":["mos","t"],"n36":"a","n37":"Su","n38":"plan,","n40":"Nos","n41":["da","i"],"n42":["mos","t"],"n43":"a","n44":"Su","n45":"plan,","n47":"La","n48":["tie","i"],"n49":["rra‿a","m"],"n50":["sí","t"],"n52":["con","i"],"n53":["quis","m"],"n54":["ta","m"],"n55":["rá,","t"],"n56":"Nos","n57":["da","i"],"n58":["mos","t"],"n59":"a","n60":"Su","n61":"plan."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Nos trajo Cristo a disfrutar","Con nuestro Dios Su dulce hogar;","¡Oh aleluya! ¿Quién dirá?","Cuán dulce es Su hogar!"]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Su casa se hace la ciudad,","¡Que a las naciones gozo da!","En donde Dios puede reinar:","El monte de Sion."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["La tierra Cristo ganará,","Su reino se establecerá,","Y desde Sion prorrumpirá","El gozo del Señor."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Por Cristo Dios tendrá Su hogar,","Que crecerá en la ciudad,","La tierra así conquistará,","Nos damos a Su plan."]}]}